                "text": "I know the cost of healthcare is way too high.\n\nWhich is why I'm urging Illinoisans in need of coverage to search for plans on the ACA marketplace this enrollment period. 4 out of 5 enrollees can find a plan for $10/month or less.\n\nVisit https://t.co/qGGGnY0ix2 by December 15.",
