                "text": "Big win for #IL17 families: The administration just repealed part of a harmful \u201cRefusal of Care\u201d rule that allowed providers to deny care based on personal beliefs.\n\nThis dangerous rule had huge impacts, including on women seeking abortions and LGBTQ+ patients.",
