                "text": "In the wake of Dobbs, women are crossing state lines to get reproductive health care in Illinois.\n\nI support @RepCaraveoMD's ACCESS Act so #IL17 providers can get resources to help patients.\n\nFrom @kwqcnews\ud83c\udfa5 https://t.co/34tSdwOLUD",
