                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "One of the nation\u2019s largest insurance companies, State Farm, is headquartered in #IL17.\n\nAnd as our country processes the scope of the CA wildfires, it\u2019s important to make sure those insured are taken care of and premiums stay affordable for our neighbors back home. (1/2) https://t.co/2gBpneUNFx",
