                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Hospitals across our district are sounding the alarm if the House GOP follows through to cut $880,000,000,000 from Medicaid.\n\nIt\u2019s not just that poor Americans lose service, we all will when rural hospitals and clinics close down.\n\nI met with @IHAHospitals to talk about how we can keep the doors open and ensure that people remain connected to health care.",
