                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "I sat down with public health officials from across #IL17 to make sure our hospitals and communities are prepared to deal with the fallout from Republicans\u2019 so-called \u201cbig beautiful bill.\u201d\n\nBut there\u2019s nothing \u201cbeautiful\u201d about ripping health care away from my neighbors.\n\nTogether, I\u2019m working with health care leaders in the district to fight to prevent people from losing their health insurance.",
