                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The House GOP\u2019s massive cuts to Medicaid are threatening rural hospitals right here in #IL17.\n\nI\u2019m doing everything I can to make sure that doesn\u2019t happen. Proud to announce that OSF Healthcare Systems in Peoria are receiving federal funding to keep our neighbors healthy. https://t.co/h11PhxxJgx",
