                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m co-sponsoring bipartisan bills to:\n\n\u2705 Expand TRICARE coverage for military kids to age 26\n\u2705 Make student loan forgiveness accessible to National Guard & reservists\nOur servicemembers deserve our full support \u2014 and I\u2019m proud to deliver for them and their families. https://t.co/SwO72juNzX",
