                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Millions of people across the country \u2013 including many in #IL17 \u2013 are going to see their health insurance premiums skyrocket.\n\nI am here in Washington D.C. with a plan to reopen the government and bring down health care costs because it\u2019s unacceptable to price people out of insurance.\n\nWatch the full interview here: https://t.co/DiX1Xz5oHv",
